  Slug: witness-to-ancient-battles
  DisplayName: Witness to Ancient Battles
  IconPath: icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-moon.webp
  Description: 'Witnesses to ancient battles may be the lingering remnants of soldiers
    who never returned from their last deployment or the restless souls of warriors
    whose final contest left them unfulfilled. Or the apparitions may be valkyries
    and other beings from beyond, naturally drawn to sites of death and battle, or
    even the unquiet entity formed from a battlefield that saw so much death and
    blood it gained a spiritual essence of its own. Witnesses to ancient battles
    are often somber and grim. Apparition Skills Battlegrounds Lore, Heraldry Lore
    Apparition Spells Cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shield] 1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sure
    Strike] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge] 3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ghostly
    Weapon] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Weapon Storm] 5th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Invoke
    Spirits] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal Calamity] 7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.True
    Target] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Canticle of Everlasting Grief]
    9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Weapon of Judgment] Vessel Spell @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Embodiment
    of Battle] Avatar General of Endless Battle Speed 70 feet, immune to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized]
    Melee 1 final strike (agile, fatal d12, reach 15 feet), Damage @Damage[(6d8+6)[slashing]]'
